export default "<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n<p>Last updated: 31 October 2026</p>\n<p>This Privacy Policy explains how Regulated handles your personal information. It covers the Regulated Android app and the Regulated web app at https://regulatedapp.co.</p>\n<h2>Who we are</h2>\n<p>Regulated is a guided audio app for wind-down and nervous-system routines. It is published by Advanced Communication Techniques Pty Ltd, South Australia, Australia. Regulated is presented with Matthew Tweedie Hypnosis.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Developer name as shown on the Google Play listing: Advanced Communication Techniques Pty Ltd</li>\n<li>ABN: 65 154 479 213</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Privacy and support contact: info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au</p>\n<h2>Who Regulated is for</h2>\n<p>Regulated is for people aged 13 and over. It is not directed at children under 13.</p>\n<h2>Your privacy rights</h2>\n<p>The Privacy Act 1988 and the Australian Privacy Principles apply. You can ask to access or correct your personal information. Email info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au to do this. If you are unhappy with the response, you can complain to the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC).</p>\n<h2>Information we collect, and why</h2>\n<div class=\"legal-table\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Category</th>\n<th>What is collected</th>\n<th>Why</th>\n<th>Processed by</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Account</td>\n<td>Your email address, account ID and sign-in session</td>\n<td>To create and secure your account, let you sign in, and give you access to what you have bought</td>\n<td>Supabase (authentication, database, file storage); Vercel (app hosting and API)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Support (optional, only for clients linked to a practitioner)</td>\n<td>Private messages, notes, task entries and reactions between you and your linked practitioner. May include health-related information you choose to share.</td>\n<td>To let you and your practitioner work together in the app</td>\n<td>Supabase. Visible only to you and that practitioner.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Courses and listening</td>\n<td>Your course access, lesson completion and progress, stored on the server. Some listening progress is stored only on your device.</td>\n<td>To show your progress and give you access to purchased courses</td>\n<td>Supabase; Vercel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optional check-in</td>\n<td>How you say you are feeling before or after a session, if you choose to answer</td>\n<td>To show you your own check-ins and history</td>\n<td>Supabase; Vercel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App activity</td>\n<td>Which features are used, including event names and the plan you choose when starting an upgrade</td>\n<td>To keep the app working and understand which features are used</td>\n<td>Regulated's own API on Vercel; Supabase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Purchases in the Android app</td>\n<td>Your subscription purchase and renewal records, linked to your account ID</td>\n<td>To unlock Premium and restore it on a new device</td>\n<td>Google Play (takes the payment); RevenueCat (purchase records and access)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Purchases on the website</td>\n<td>Your order and payment references. For custom audio, the request text you write, which may include personal information.</td>\n<td>To process orders, unlock purchases and make custom audio</td>\n<td>Stripe (takes the payment; Regulated does not receive full card numbers); Supabase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Email</td>\n<td>Your email address and message content for account and delivery emails</td>\n<td>To send sign-in, receipt and delivery emails</td>\n<td>Resend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Website notifications (optional, web only)</td>\n<td>Your browser push subscription details</td>\n<td>To send the Support notifications you turned on</td>\n<td>Supabase; the browser's push service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Technical</td>\n<td>Your IP address and request logs created when using the service</td>\n<td>To run, secure and troubleshoot the service</td>\n<td>Vercel; Supabase</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h2>How information is used and shared</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No information is sold. There is no advertising, and no information is used for advertising.</li>\n<li>Information is shared only:</li>\n<li>with the service providers listed above, so they can run the service on Regulated's behalf;</li>\n<li>with your linked practitioner, for Support content; or</li>\n<li>where the law requires.</li>\n<li>Some providers may store or process information outside Australia, including in the United States.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Security</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Information is encrypted in transit (HTTPS).</li>\n<li>Account data is protected by access controls. You can see only your own information. Support content is visible only to you and your linked practitioner.</li>\n<li>Information stored in the Supabase database (account, Support, course and check-in information) is encrypted at rest using AES-256.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Deleting your account</h2>\n<p>You can ask to delete your account and its associated data at any time. Requests are completed within 30 days of being received.</p>\n<p>To ask, choose one:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In the app: sign in and open the account deletion screen.</li>\n<li>On the web: sign in at https://regulatedapp.co/delete-account and send the request.</li>\n<li>By email: write to info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au from your account's email address.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Deleting your account does not cancel a Google Play subscription. The Delete your account page explains how to cancel it first.</p>\n<p>After deletion, we keep some records:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Payment and tax records: 5 years, as Australian tax law requires.</li>\n<li>Support messages and notes: 7 years as clinical records. They are kept securely, then deleted.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Copies in provider backups and logs are removed on those providers' own schedules. We ask our service providers to delete your data too.</p>\n<h2>Contact</h2>\n<p>Questions about privacy: info@matthewtweediehypnosis.com.au.</p>"
